<title>JAPAN: Ito En shares jump due to hot weather.</title>
<headline>Ito En shares jump due to hot weather.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ito En Ltd, a manufacturer of various kinds of drinks, especially Japanese teas, jumped to a new high for 1997 as the hot summer weather will help increase its sales, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0121 GMT, the share price of Ito En rose 40 yen to 2,730, a new high for this calendar year. Volume was 144,000 shares.</p>
